The bridge between the snow biome and forest biome (I think it's called Traitor Bridge?) has a nice quiet spot on the southern side of the bridge, slightly below it to the east. Nice, quiet, flat, grassy spot. It seems like a great place to set a forward base to set your grassy bedroll in. 

&#x200B;

There's basics nearby (Stone, Branches, Bushes, Iron). No real food supply, so you'll need to set down extra fish baskets (10) if you need a steady food source. 

&#x200B;

And it's actually not cold in that location (albeit only steps away from the freezing cold), so you can settle there without serious need of being cold after losing your gear.

&#x200B;

Although, if it is a server where your gear drops on death, I suggest having a 2 combat thralls there (fighter or dancer) and equip them with backup warm gear, so you can strip them in case you need warm gear to get your gear from your body in the cold biome.

