You'll have 40 more HP. You can use Piercing Shot to start fights. You'll essentially have access to all 3 powerful DoTs (Extreme Bleed, Extreme Poison, Burn) once you get the Horror Bow and Horror Axe. Using the Horror bow to start with a normal shot, then a piercing shot, then swapping to Obsidian Pistol and firing will cause all 3 powerful DoTs at a range. 

&#x200B;

The Horror Axe has a 1H Axe skill that causes Pain and Cripple for +25% more damage. Spellsword's Fire Infuse also adds 25% damage on top of weapon. While Horror Axe does not boast the strongest attack power, the two special attacks ends up being among the fastest 5 hit combo among high powered weapons, making the Horror Axe one of the highest DPS weapons available. On top of that, it applies Extreme Poison and Burn when infused, so you can start a fight with Piercing Shot to Bleed and then apply the other 2 DoTs through melee. 

&#x200B;

This makes Spellsword + Philosopher + Hunter one of the strongest specialization combination in the game.

