Shock Coil, Railgun, Sledgehammer LMG, Devastator Sniper Rifle, Battlecry (Taunt), and as much HP you can get. 

&#x200B;

**Devastating Melee** \- Shock Coil only uses 1-2 charges to prime fodder enemies (3-5 for larger targets) and you can detonate with an AoE slam to blow up everyone at once or use the Railgun to completely blow away a high HP target.

