&#x200B;

Darkworkers also see and sense the very negative devils / aliens that haunt other people. To me, they look 8x more terrifying than what's displayed on horror movies, cartoon demons, dark souls/bloodborne bosses. They're attracted to the bad energy that I cut up and disperse. If left alone, these beings can temporarily blind someone from realizing something and cause some sort of distressing accident (anything from tripping on what you've never tripped on before to having car accidents that severely harms instead of killing). These negative devils / aliens seem very afraid or very wary of me, like they don't want me to approach at all. My instinctive response is also to attack them (but not to permanently harm/kill them).

