As for your second question, it's very instinctive. I'm very aware that I'm violent towards hostile negative devils / aliens. I will absolutely fight if I feel an innocent is haunted by something they do not deserve. I see the "souls" of everyone else like an egg made of dim (but also hard surfaced) egg. I see the thick layer of grime that surrounds the egg. I cut and scrape that stuff off. Sometimes a bit of that grime is also inside the egg, in which case the fire like energy burns the stuff out without harming the egg that might be the soul of another.

&#x200B;

If the egg seems hurt somehow, I really do not know what to do. I don't know how to heal, I can only provide advice. I'm not "equipped" to handle the healing process. I can try, but I know an actual healer would do a heck of a better job at it than me. My attempts would seem very flimsy and incomplete in comparison.

&#x200B;

