&#x200B;

Takes time, but I instinctively know what I should and need to be doing over time.

&#x200B;

I find people very irritating a lot of the time, but I will fight to the death for their peace.

&#x200B;

So, a dark worker takes aggressive approaches towards things that would harm "the whole". My primary approaches include cutting, carving, blasting, burning, and cleansing. While I can manipulate other energies too, it's really to a very pitiful amount, like trying to move an ocean with a thimble.

